Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:23:03.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論何種命運 都會在其最後 綻放耀眼光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:06.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們並不孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:10.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,相互扶持 相互溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:13.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,以音樂相繫的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:15.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,放聲高歌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.86,0:23:17.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,向著明日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,與你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:23.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,協奏的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:26.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,管弦樂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
